Z||000000||goldfinger||10-11-2000||10:51 PM||||I have wanted one since I was 10, now im 16. I registered on here almost a year ago now and I mostly read, well I read for about 3 hours a night up until about 6 months ago then I didn't because my fiero hopes were down the about a week ago, my buddy that told me he would give me his like a year ago said I just bought a new car and you want my fiero for free, and it runs but it had no brakes and need rotors. He works for a tech unversity so the mechanics club there is putting on rotors and brakes on it for free and getting the parts for 50% off normal prices. My dad will pay for that stuff and the car is free. My dad can get insurance for it for around 400$ a year. So he told me today that I will have a new fiero monday. I already have a system in my Corsica now that I will take out and put it in there. More on my future system later. But I want to paid my 86 2m4 orange and put pimpin rims, an underbody neon kit, tint the windows, just to name a few mods I will do in the near future, I will take pics of it with my digi camera.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Seanh||10-11-2000||11:16 PM||||I am going to catch hell for this. That is great though. I do enjoy doing stuff like that to my car. I would love for new paint, but mine is good for now, but maybe in the future. Neon is a pain in the Fiero. I have some interior neon. It is 1/8" bendable tube that glows blue. I am going to put it on after the rebuild. I also have aqua neon under it. I am going to lower it about 1.5" and get me some 18" rims, lots of metal showing, nice shiny chrome. I also love to see people putting awsome systems in Fieros so I would like to hear more about yours. Good luck. Make it awsome.<P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Killer Stereo System||||reg||1
